# Convergence = conjunction: a gene is a confirmed component of the population-specific mechanism only
# where INDEPENDENT lenses co-occur. Either a KNOWN signaling role (substrate, §2b) OR pure-data
# co-expression, AND a real population-differentiation signal (L2-computed, §3b). Literal objects both
# sides, single subject — sidesteps the re-binding gotcha.
if x amplifies signal and x differentiates population then x becomes component
if x senses pathogen and x differentiates population then x becomes component
if x relays signal and x differentiates population then x becomes component
if x tracks seed and x differentiates population then x becomes component
if x binds seed and x differentiates population then x becomes component
if x wires presentation and x differentiates population then x becomes component
# GRADED: the stacked intensity marker deepens a confirmed component into a CORE component — an extra
# hop, so a top-tier-differentiated component outranks a moderate one by structural significance (κ),
# not by a smuggled scalar. This is how ordinal intensity reaches the significance layer.
if x becomes component and x dominates population then x becomes core
